write('NationalNightOut.htm','National Night Out','An August 2004 community gathering at Plaza De Magnolia.',intro('National Night Out.','August 3, 2004 · Community archive')+'<section class="wrap"><div class="prose"><p>Plaza De Magnolia hosted its annual National Night Out, bringing neighbors together to build relationships and support crime prevention.</p><p>The original event collage below captures an evening with residents and neighbors.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="cleaner256modif.wmv" download>Download the original event video (WMV)</a></p></div><figure class="archive-image" style="margin-top:30px">'+image('images/National-Night-Out.jpg','Original collage of residents, activities, and neighborhood gatherings at National Night Out in 2004')+'</figure></section>','News')
